1
00:00:05,070 --> 00:00:07,230
-Phoebe,could you get that,please? -Why?
菲比，可以麻煩接個電話嗎？ 為什麼？

2
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,700
Just because you're too lazy to get up off your tushy?
就因為你懶得動？

3
00:00:11,310 --> 00:00:16,370
No,it's just that all the people in the world I would want to talk to are right here.
不是，只是因為在全世界 我只想跟你說話

4
00:00:17,183 --> 00:00:18,514
好吧

5
00:00:19,910 --> 00:00:21,810
Sucker.
真好騙

6
00:00:22,520 --> 00:00:23,640
Hello?
喂？

7
00:00:23,850 --> 00:00:25,790
-Hey,Joey! -Hey,Phoebe.
喬伊 菲比

8
00:00:26,020 --> 00:00:27,250
I need a favor.
幫我個忙好嗎？

9
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:30,820
I forgot the PlN to my ATM card. Can you get it for me?
我忘記提款卡的密碼 你可以幫我去找嗎？

10
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,290
Sure. Where is it?
好啊，在哪裡？

11
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:35,360
I scratched it on the ATM machine on the corner.
我刻在提款機的角落那裡

12
00:00:36,260 --> 00:00:38,290
So you're 5-6-3-9?
原來5639是你的密碼

13
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:40,160
That's it! Thanks.
沒錯，菲比，謝了

14
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,190
-Wanna talk to Chandler? -Let me talk to him.
你要跟錢德說話嗎？ 是喬伊嗎？讓我跟他說

15
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:46,200
He didn't believe in my movie...
不要！他不相信我的電影

17
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:50,640
...which is a big mistake, because it is real. Real.
他大錯特錯 這次的電影是真的！…

18
00:00:51,550 --> 00:00:54,520
Tribbiani,get back to work. Break time's over.
崔比亞尼 快回去工作，休息時間結束了

20
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:59,010
-Who was that? -My stunt double. Yeah.
剛才那個是誰？ 我的替身 

21
00:00:59,190 --> 00:01:01,590
He's getting a little too familiar for my tastes.
他有點太沒大沒小了

22
00:01:03,090 --> 00:01:04,820
I've tried to apologize.
我這星期來都試著跟他道歉 

23
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:08,590
If I can't do it on the phone, I'll go and do it in person.
若他不讓我在電話上說 我就直接殺過去當面說

25
00:01:08,830 --> 00:01:10,760
I heard that. Can you put him on?
菲比，我聽到了，請他聽電話

26
00:01:10,937 --> 00:01:11,926
好

27
00:01:14,540 --> 00:01:15,530
Don't come out here.
你別過來

28
00:01:17,670 --> 00:01:21,070
I support you 100% and I wanna prove that to you in person.
不行…我百分之百支持你 我要當面證明給你看

29
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:24,540
I got that. I forgive you. Don't come out here.
收到，我原諒你，你別過來

30
00:01:24,750 --> 00:01:26,910
You haven't taken my calls for a week.
原諒我？ 你一星期都不接我電話

31
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:30,950
I'm totally over it. Friends forever. Don't come out here.
錢德，我早都不介意了 咱們是一輩子的朋友 你別過來

33
00:01:32,350 --> 00:01:34,620
Would you mind doing a picture with us?
可以跟我們照張相嗎？

34
00:01:35,690 --> 00:01:38,520
-What was that? -Entertainment Tonight.
那是什麼？ 「今夜娛樂」節目

36
00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:43,630
Good talking to you and don't come out here.
好了，很高興跟你說話 你別過來

37
00:01:47,040 --> 00:01:49,400
The One in Vegas
本集播出：「賭城行」

00:01:50,040 --> 00:01:51,400
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

38
00:02:34,580 --> 00:02:38,450
Monica? I'm sorry I'm late.
摩妮卡，抱歉我遲到了

39
00:02:41,528 --> 00:02:42,756
摩妮卡？

40
00:02:44,297 --> 00:02:45,491
菲比？

41
00:02:46,530 --> 00:02:49,000
I'm so sorry. Have you been here long?
菲比，真對不起 你到很久了嗎？

42
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,830
That's okay.
沒關係啦

44
00:02:51,470 --> 00:02:53,230
What the hell took you so long?
你怎麼拖了那麼久？

45
00:02:55,870 --> 00:02:58,530
You can't tell Chandler. I ran into Richard.
好，不許你跟錢德說 我遇見了理查

46
00:02:58,740 --> 00:03:00,210
-Which Richard? -The Richard.
哪個理查？ 那個理查

48
00:03:00,410 --> 00:03:02,570
Richard Simmons? Oh,my God!
理查西蒙斯?（減重專家） 天啊

49
00:03:03,910 --> 00:03:08,180
No,my ex-boyfriend Richard. You know, the tall guy, mustache.
不是啦，是我前男友理查 個子高高，有鬍子那個

50
00:03:08,380 --> 00:03:11,750
Okay, that actually makes more sense. How was it?
好吧，這就說得過去了 情況如何？

51
00:03:11,950 --> 00:03:15,750
It was really nice. We talked and I had lunch with him.
好極了，我們先是閒聊 後來一起吃了個午飯

53
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:19,090
That's weird. I dreamed you had lunch with Richard.
怪了，我有夢到你跟理查吃飯

54
00:03:19,290 --> 00:03:21,230
-Really? -Again, Richard Simmons.
真的？ 不過是跟理查西蒙斯啦

55
00:03:22,030 --> 00:03:23,020
Go on.
你繼續說

56
00:03:23,260 --> 00:03:25,760
The strange part was he was really nice...
奇怪的是雖然他很棒也很帥

57
00:03:25,970 --> 00:03:28,870
...and he looks great, but I didn't feel anything.
但是我對他完全沒感覺了

58
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:30,930
So why can't we tell Chandler?
那為什麼不能跟錢德說？

59
00:03:31,140 --> 00:03:35,700
It'll freak him out and tomorrow's our anniversary. I don't wanna spoil it.
因為他聽了一定會發神經 明天就是我們的紀念日 我不想搞砸

61
00:03:35,910 --> 00:03:38,970
I can't believe you guys have lasted a whole year!
不敢相信你們交往一年了

62
00:03:39,210 --> 00:03:41,480
Wow, I owe Rachel 20 bucks.
我欠瑞秋20美元

63
00:03:43,790 --> 00:03:45,620
On a totally different bet.
那是完全不相干的賭局啦

65
00:03:49,720 --> 00:03:52,120
-It's almost our anniversary! -I know.
一週年紀念日快到了 我知道

66
00:03:52,330 --> 00:03:55,960
One year ago today,I was just your annoying friend Chandler.
你相信嗎？一年前的今天 我還是只是煩人的朋友錢德

68
00:03:56,430 --> 00:03:59,130
Now you're just my annoying friend Chandler.
現在你是我煩人的朋友錢德

69
00:04:00,770 --> 00:04:01,760
I got you a gift.
我幫你買了禮物

70
00:04:01,970 --> 00:04:05,770
-It's not till tomorrow. -I know,but you have to open it today.
紀念日明天才到 我知道，但你今天就要開禮物

73
00:04:18,450 --> 00:04:20,610
Okay! There you go!
我來啦

74
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:22,910
It's two tickets to Vegas!
兩張去賭城的機票

75
00:04:23,690 --> 00:04:26,660
Yeah! For this weekend! It'll be perfect.
這週末的來回機票 一定很完美

76
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:30,990
You'll see Joey, plus,we'll start our celebration on the plane.
不但能去看喬伊 還能在飛機上開始過紀念日

77
00:04:31,270 --> 00:04:34,330
We can call it our "Plane-aversary."
就叫做「飛機紀念日」吧

78
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,400
Do we have to?
一定要這樣叫？

79
00:04:38,540 --> 00:04:41,870
This is great, but Joey didn't want any of us there.
這是很棒沒錯 但喬伊說了不要我們過去

81
00:04:42,110 --> 00:04:46,770
He doesn't want us to go to any trouble. He'll be excited when we surprise him.
他只是怕麻煩我們而已 到時我們突然出現 他一定超興奮的

83
00:04:47,050 --> 00:04:50,850
Plus,we get to have our own "Anna-Vegas-ry"!
而且我們自己還有賭城紀念日

84
00:04:52,890 --> 00:04:55,480
"Anna-vada-versary!"
內華達紀念日！

85
00:04:56,360 --> 00:04:58,950
I think we should see other people.
對，我們該開始和別人交往

86
00:04:59,160 --> 00:05:00,530
We can go, right?
我們可以去吧？ 對

87
00:05:00,830 --> 00:05:01,990
Great idea.
那就好 這是個好主意

88
00:05:02,200 --> 00:05:03,490
I'm gonna go too!
好耶，我也要去

89
00:05:06,670 --> 00:05:08,800
Phoebe,it's kind of our anniversary.
菲比，這是我倆的紀念日耶

90
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:11,730
You won't ditch me like you did with London.
少來，休想比照倫敦那次 把我甩掉

91
00:05:11,970 --> 00:05:13,740
Ditch you? You were pregnant
菲比，哪有甩掉？ 當時你懷了三胞胎耶

92
00:05:13,980 --> 00:05:15,530
Great story. I'm going.
真會掰，我非去不可

93
00:05:20,650 --> 00:05:24,850
Listen, this weekend we're all gonna go to Las Vegas to surprise Joey!
注意，這週末大家一起去賭城 給喬伊一個驚喜

94
00:05:26,820 --> 00:05:28,350
Including me!
包括我！

95
00:05:29,060 --> 00:05:30,050
Do you wanna go?
你們要去嗎？

96
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:32,190
I can take a couple days off work.
我應該可以請個幾天假

97
00:05:32,390 --> 00:05:36,830
Of course you can take a couple days off, because this trip includes me!
你當然可以請幾天假 因為這趟我也要去！

98
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:41,460
I've got a presentation tomorrow. I can't miss that.
等等，差點忘了 我明天要提報告，不能缺席

99
00:05:41,670 --> 00:05:45,660
I've got tickets to the Van Gogh exhibit. I waited a year for this.
我也買了梵谷畫展的票 我盼了一年才盼到

100
00:05:46,410 --> 00:05:48,430
Art lover.
藝術愛好者

101
00:05:52,850 --> 00:05:54,470
What'd you say?
你說什麼？

102
00:05:54,650 --> 00:05:57,050
I said,art lover.
我說藝術愛好者

103
00:05:57,220 --> 00:06:01,180
-Was that supposed to be an insult? -I don't know,I'm very tired.
那是用來侮辱人的嗎？ 不知道，我很累了

105
00:06:01,520 --> 00:06:04,820
-Rach, maybe we can fly out Saturday? -Sounds great.
瑞秋，不如你我週六再飛去？ 聽起來很可行

106
00:06:05,060 --> 00:06:06,490
I'll call the airlines.
好，那我打電話去訂票

107
00:06:07,460 --> 00:06:10,360
That'll be nice to have the apartment to myself.
其實想起來很不賴 我可以獨自在公寓過一晚

108
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,520
To walk around naked.
對，你可以脫光光到處走

109
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:18,460
No,so I can be by myself. Have a little alone time.
不是，我可以自己一個人 享受獨處的時光

110
00:06:19,040 --> 00:06:20,340
Naked alone time.
脫光光的獨處時光

111
00:06:21,210 --> 00:06:24,800
Just because I'm alone doesn't mean I wanna walk around naked.
菲比，我一個人獨處 並不表示我就想脫光光到處走

112
00:06:25,080 --> 00:06:27,410
You live alone, you don't walk around naked.
你自己一個人住 你也不會脫光光到處走啊

113
00:06:27,650 --> 00:06:30,550
Why does it takes me so long to answer the door?
你以為我為何老半天才應門？

114
00:06:38,960 --> 00:06:43,620
So far,is this trip to Las Vegas better or worse than the trip to London?
這趟旅程旅程到現在為止 比起倫敦那趟好還是壞？

115
00:06:43,930 --> 00:06:46,530
So far, it's pretty much the same,Phoebe.
菲比，到現在為止都差不多

116
00:06:47,270 --> 00:06:50,470
What about after I give you these candies?
好，那我給你們糖果之後呢？

117
00:06:51,810 --> 00:06:54,210
I guess it's a little better now.
對，我想好一點了

118
00:06:54,940 --> 00:06:58,430
Las Vegas,1. London,0.
好，賭城1分，倫敦0分

119
00:06:59,250 --> 00:07:00,940
I'll be back.
我馬上回來

120
00:07:03,890 --> 00:07:05,440
Happy Plane-aversary.
飛機紀念日快樂

121
00:07:07,120 --> 00:07:08,650
I love you.
我愛你

122
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:11,790
-Can I give you your present now? -Okay!
禮物能趁現在給你嗎？ 好啊

124
00:07:16,330 --> 00:07:18,320
Oh, don't tell me I did this.
要命，不會吧？

125
00:07:18,600 --> 00:07:21,970
I love "l forgot the present" fake-out!
我最愛你假裝沒帶禮物了

126
00:07:22,670 --> 00:07:26,400
How about "I did forget the present, forgive me" not fake-out?
那如果我是真的沒帶禮物 請你多多包涵呢？

127
00:07:26,970 --> 00:07:29,410
You can give it to me when we get back.
沒關係啦，別放在心上 等回去再給我就行了

128
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:32,010
This is the worst thing that could happen.
紀念日發生這種事 真是再掃興不過了

129
00:07:32,250 --> 00:07:35,150
You decided to tell him about the Richard thing.
很好，你最後還是決定 要跟錢德說理查的事了

130
00:07:39,350 --> 00:07:40,680
What "Richard thing"?
什麼理查的事？

131
00:07:40,920 --> 00:07:42,790
Oh,no.
糟糕

132
00:07:44,590 --> 00:07:45,620
What "Richard thing"?
什麼理查的事？

133
00:07:45,830 --> 00:07:47,660
Simmons. Go with Simmons.
用西蒙斯混過去

135
00:07:54,840 --> 00:07:56,770
I ran into Richard yesterday.
好吧，我昨天遇到了理查

136
00:07:56,970 --> 00:08:00,670
He asked me if I wanted to go for a bite and I did.
他問我要不要一起吃飯 我答應了

137
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:03,470
I didn't tell you because you'd get mad...
我沒跟你說是因為我知道你會生氣

138
00:08:03,680 --> 00:08:06,170
...and I didn't wanna spoil our anniversary.
而我不想毀了週年紀念日

139
00:08:06,780 --> 00:08:08,270
I'm not mad.
我不生氣啊

140
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:12,380
Really?
真的？ 是啊…

141
00:08:12,690 --> 00:08:15,780
So you bumped into Richard. You grabbed a "bite."
你遇到理查，一起吃飯

142
00:08:18,360 --> 00:08:19,990
No big deal.
沒啥大不了的

143
00:08:23,060 --> 00:08:24,460
Great.
太好了

144
00:08:28,140 --> 00:08:30,570
Okay, London,1.
好，倫敦1分

145
00:08:31,570 --> 00:08:34,410
This is gonna be a real horserace.
這將會是一場拉鋸戰

146
00:09:08,780 --> 00:09:10,370
Oh,look what happened.
怎麼會這樣

147
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:14,610
Check me out.
瞧瞧我自己

148
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:17,210
I'm in my kitchen...
我在自家的廚房

149
00:09:17,420 --> 00:09:18,910
...naked.
脫光光

150
00:09:19,750 --> 00:09:22,280
I'm picking up an orange.
拿起一顆柳丁

151
00:09:22,820 --> 00:09:23,920
I'm naked.
我脫光光

152
00:09:26,590 --> 00:09:29,120
I'm lighting the candles.
點起蠟燭

153
00:09:29,330 --> 00:09:32,130
Naked. And carefully.
脫光光，要小心

154
00:09:43,110 --> 00:09:46,010
Oh,my God! That's Rachel, naked!
天啊，瑞秋脫光光

155
00:09:48,250 --> 00:09:50,810
I can't look at that. I am looking at this.
不能看，我在看書

156
00:09:51,020 --> 00:09:54,980
Okay, vivid colors, expressive brush strokes.
好，鮮明的色彩、有力的筆觸

157
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:59,990
Unless she wants me to be looking at that.
她故意要我看就另當別論了

158
00:10:00,700 --> 00:10:02,420
She knows I'm home.
她知道我在家

159
00:10:02,660 --> 00:10:05,530
She knows I can see her.
她知道我看得到她

160
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:09,360
What kind of game is she playing?
她這是在玩什麼把戲？

161
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:13,600
I think maybe someone's lonely tonight.
也許今晚有人寂寞

162
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:16,040
Dr. Geller.
蓋勒博士

163
00:10:16,310 --> 00:10:19,370
Stop it. You're being silly.
別胡思亂想 自討沒趣了

164
00:10:21,150 --> 00:10:22,980
Or am I?
真是這樣嗎？

165
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:28,050
Love to love you baby

166
00:10:30,220 --> 00:10:32,120
Love to love you baby

167
00:10:40,130 --> 00:10:42,530
Love to love you baby

168
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,030
Damn it!
討厭

169
00:10:58,950 --> 00:11:00,220
May I come in?
我可以進去嗎？

170
00:11:01,760 --> 00:11:02,920
Yeah,if you want to.
想要的話就進來啊

171
00:11:03,920 --> 00:11:05,860
Do you want me to?
你要我進去嗎？

172
00:11:07,630 --> 00:11:08,790
Yeah,sure?
當然羅？

173
00:11:09,030 --> 00:11:10,860
So do l.
彼此彼此

174
00:11:15,470 --> 00:11:18,930
Okay,Rach,before anything happens...
瑞秋，在一切還沒開始之前

175
00:11:19,210 --> 00:11:21,900
...I wanna lay down a couple of ground rules.
有幾個原則我想先說清楚

176
00:11:22,110 --> 00:11:24,810
This is just about tonight.
這只適用於今晚

177
00:11:25,080 --> 00:11:29,210
I won't go through with this if it'll raise the question of "us."
今晚過後，你是你，我是我

178
00:11:31,320 --> 00:11:32,790
I just want this to be...
好嗎？我希望這一切…

179
00:11:35,890 --> 00:11:37,880
...about what it is.
只是各取所需

180
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,260
And...

181
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,290
...what is that,Ross?
羅斯，什麼各取所需？

182
00:11:45,570 --> 00:11:48,130
The physical act of love.
出自於獸慾的性愛

183
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:51,100
What, are you crazy?
什麼？你瘋了不成？

184
00:11:51,310 --> 00:11:56,140
So you weren't trying to entice me just now with your nakedness?
所以你剛才脫光光 不是在勾引我？

185
00:11:59,110 --> 00:12:01,510
Oh,God. You saw me?
天啊，你有看到？

186
00:12:05,250 --> 00:12:09,420
You weren't trying to entice me with your nakedness?
你脫光光不是在勾引我

188
00:12:10,930 --> 00:12:15,020
You actually thought I wanted to have sex with you?
當然不是 你當真以為我想跟你上床？

189
00:12:15,134 --> 00:12:17,125
才不是呢…

190
00:12:18,971 --> 00:12:20,632
不是

191
00:12:22,108 --> 00:12:29,173
不是…

192
00:12:30,810 --> 00:12:35,870
Oh,wow. I'm sorry. But,Ross, you kicked off your shoes.
我很抱歉 可是你還把鞋踢掉了耶

193
00:12:36,050 --> 00:12:40,780
-Can we just forget this ever happened? -Of course. You're right. I'm sorry.
能不能忘了這件事？ 當然可以，沒問題 你說的對，抱歉

195
00:12:40,960 --> 00:12:42,580
-Thank you. -Yes.
謝謝

196
00:12:42,760 --> 00:12:45,920
-I guess I'm gonna go pack. -Okay. Wait,one more thing.
那我應該回去打包了 好 等等，還有一件事

197
00:12:46,090 --> 00:12:50,260
Do we still need to settle the question of "us"?
還要解決誰是誰的問題嗎？

199
00:13:13,950 --> 00:13:16,550
Hey,you guys,wait! You guys.
你們等等啊

200
00:13:16,820 --> 00:13:19,050
This place is much better than London.
等等我 這地方比倫敦好多了吧

202
00:13:19,330 --> 00:13:21,950
A lady dressed like Cleopatra gave me this.
有個打扮成埃及艷後的女士 給了我這張折價券

203
00:13:22,230 --> 00:13:24,700
Ninety-nine cent steak and lobster dinner.
99美分就能吃到牛排龍蝦晚餐

204
00:13:24,970 --> 00:13:26,330
You don't eat animals.
菲比，你又不吃肉

205
00:13:26,570 --> 00:13:28,870
For ninety-nine cents I'd eat you.
不用一美元，我連你都吃

206
00:13:30,300 --> 00:13:32,470
I can totally settle down here.
我完全可以耗在這裡 

207
00:13:32,670 --> 00:13:36,870
It's got everything I could ever want. Including Joey! Look!
我要的東西應有盡有 就連喬伊都在，你們看！

209
00:13:37,980 --> 00:13:39,140
Look! Hey!
快點看！ 

210
00:13:39,550 --> 00:13:40,640
Oh,my God.
天啊

211
00:13:41,687 --> 00:13:43,177
喬伊！

212
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:49,710
Love your condoms,my man.
你的保險套真不賴

213
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:53,560
Why are you here? I told you not to come.
你們怎麼在這裡？ 不是要你們別來了？

214
00:13:53,790 --> 00:13:55,790
Why are you dressed as a gladiator?
你幹嘛打扮成神鬼戰士？

215
00:13:56,530 --> 00:14:00,560
Because I'm shooting a scene right now. I play a gladiator.
因為我正在拍戲 我扮演神鬼戰士

216
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:04,700
Hold on a second. Can we cut?
你們等等 可以卡一下嗎？

218
00:14:05,010 --> 00:14:07,410
My friends are here. I'm gonna take a break.
我朋友來了 我要休息一下

219
00:14:07,880 --> 00:14:09,570
Who are you talking to?
你是在跟誰說話？

220
00:14:10,880 --> 00:14:12,400
The director.
導演啊

221
00:14:12,650 --> 00:14:13,840
Her.
就是她

222
00:14:17,050 --> 00:14:20,080
All right,it's not a gladiator movie. I work here.
好啦，我不是在拍神鬼戰士 我在這裡工作

223
00:14:20,350 --> 00:14:21,820
Why? What happened?
為什麼？發生了什麼事？

224
00:14:22,020 --> 00:14:24,050
The movie shut down. Ran out of money.
那部電影因為沒錢而停拍

225
00:14:24,330 --> 00:14:27,590
I'm working here till it starts up, if it ever does.
我在這裡工作等電影重新開拍 如果真有這一天的話

226
00:14:27,830 --> 00:14:29,520
-I'm so sorry. -Such a drag.
我真的很遺憾

227
00:14:29,760 --> 00:14:31,990
Sorry I didn't tell you. I'm sorry.
對不起 沒跟你們說，抱歉

228
00:14:32,230 --> 00:14:35,360
Apparently there's a new policy of not sharing.
沒關係… 互相隱瞞顯然成了新的規矩

229
00:14:35,570 --> 00:14:39,060
-I knew you weren't okay with that. -So you're a gladiator!
我就知道你聽了會有疙瘩 你是神鬼戰士耶

231
00:14:40,010 --> 00:14:41,440
What's going on?
他們怎麼了？

232
00:14:41,710 --> 00:14:44,540
-Monica had lunch with Richard. -Dawson?
摩妮卡跟理查吃了中飯 理查道森？（英國演員）

234
00:14:47,180 --> 00:14:49,620
But that would've been so cool!
不是啦，要不然一定超酷的

235
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,450
Her boyfriend Richard.
是那個男朋友理查

236
00:14:51,690 --> 00:14:55,950
It meant nothing. After all this time, how can you not trust me?
那根本不礙事 你怎麼到現在還不相信我？

237
00:14:56,190 --> 00:14:59,630
When you go lunching with hunky men and don't tell me!
你瞞著我跟大鬍子帥哥吃午餐 要我怎麼相信你？

238
00:15:01,800 --> 00:15:04,700
You're right. I'm sorry. I should've told you.
你說的對，對不起 我早該跟你說的

239
00:15:05,270 --> 00:15:06,260
Thanks.
謝謝 

240
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:09,970
-There we go. -Now I love Vegas.
這樣才對嘛 我愛賭城

241
00:15:11,070 --> 00:15:14,100
I promise you next time I absolutely will tell you.
我保證下次一定會跟你說

242
00:15:17,780 --> 00:15:20,580
-"Next time"? -So close.
下一次？ 敗在最後

244
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:24,610
There won't be a next time. You cannot see him again.
下不為例，你不能再跟他見面

245
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:28,480
I cannot see him? You can't tell me what to do.
我不能跟他見面？ 你不能對我發號施令

246
00:15:28,720 --> 00:15:30,660
That's funny, I think I just did.
有趣，剛才不就是了

247
00:15:31,760 --> 00:15:34,420
If you act like this, I won't be around you.
你這種態度，我眼不見為淨 我無所謂

248
00:15:34,730 --> 00:15:36,290
-Fine. -Happy anniversary!
好！紀念日快樂

249
00:15:36,530 --> 00:15:39,000
Guys,please! Come on,come on.
你們別這樣嘛 

250
00:15:39,200 --> 00:15:41,290
This is obviously a misunderstanding.
這顯然是個大誤會

251
00:15:41,540 --> 00:15:42,590
No,it is not.
才不是誤會 你在說什麼…

252
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:45,100
Don't look at me. I just work here.
別看我，我只是在這裡工作

253
00:15:51,710 --> 00:15:56,340
Okay, Ross? I'm a little warm, so I'm gonna be taking off my sweater.
羅斯，我有點熱，要脫毛衣

254
00:15:56,550 --> 00:15:59,140
Now,I'm just letting you know...
我只是要你知道 

255
00:15:59,390 --> 00:16:03,480
...this is not an invitation to the physical act of love.
這不是在勾引你一夜情

256
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:07,450
Yep,that's hilarious.
對，真是太爆笑了

257
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:10,290
I'm sorry. I'm done. I'm done.
抱歉，我不鬧了…

258
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:13,620
You know,last night was embarrassing for you too.
昨晚對你其實也很尷尬

259
00:16:13,800 --> 00:16:17,790
No,not really. You've seen me naked hundreds of times.
不盡然啦 你看過我裸體幾百次了

260
00:16:17,970 --> 00:16:20,960
But it was a first for the rest of my building.
但對我其他樓友是第一次 好吧

261
00:16:21,440 --> 00:16:25,610
That's true. But I just don't embarrass that easily.
話是這樣說沒錯啦 但我沒有那麼容易尷尬

263
00:16:25,780 --> 00:16:27,940
What? You totally get embarrassed.
什麼？你根本尷尬得要死

264
00:16:28,120 --> 00:16:32,640
No,I don't. Ross,I think I'm just a more secure person than you are.
才沒有 這是因為我比你更有安全感

265
00:16:32,850 --> 00:16:34,510
-ls that so? -Yeah.
是嗎？ 是啊

266
00:16:36,390 --> 00:16:37,520
Hey,lady!
小姐

267
00:16:37,790 --> 00:16:40,160
I don't care how much you want it,okay?
不管你有多想

268
00:16:40,460 --> 00:16:43,360
I am not gonna have sex with you in the bathroom!
我絕不會和你去廁所做愛

269
00:16:48,670 --> 00:16:52,000
You know,in Roman times, this was more than just a hat.
在古羅馬時代 這不只是頂帽子而已

270
00:16:52,970 --> 00:16:55,310
-Really? -Yeah,sure,sure.
是嗎？ 當然羅…

271
00:16:55,540 --> 00:16:57,530
They would scrub the floors.
這可以用來刷地板

272
00:16:57,810 --> 00:17:00,340
They'd use it to get the mud off their shoe.
抹去鞋子上的泥巴

273
00:17:00,550 --> 00:17:03,380
Sometimes underneath the horse would get dirty.
有時候馬腹會弄髒 

274
00:17:03,580 --> 00:17:05,380
So they would stick it right
把這個戮進去就能...

275
00:17:06,250 --> 00:17:09,310
I can't believe this is how I'm spending my anniversary.
喬伊，真不敢相信 我的週年紀念日是這樣過的

276
00:17:09,520 --> 00:17:12,890
I'll take you someplace nice. A guy tipped me $100.
但我帶你去個好地方 今天有個人給我一百美元小費

278
00:17:14,360 --> 00:17:17,590
He was playing blackjack for an hour and he won $5000.
他玩21點 才一小時就贏了五千美元

279
00:17:17,900 --> 00:17:19,530
Can you believe that?
你相信嗎？五千美元耶！

280
00:17:19,730 --> 00:17:21,930
If I won $5000,I'd join a gym.
若我贏了五千美元 我就去加入健身房

281
00:17:22,170 --> 00:17:23,600
Build up my upper body...
把我的上半身練壯 

282
00:17:23,840 --> 00:17:26,330
...and hit Richard from behind with a stick.
再用棍子插理查的屁眼

283
00:17:27,610 --> 00:17:30,440
Wait! Why don't I just do what that guy did?
等等，我何不傚法那個人？

284
00:17:30,710 --> 00:17:32,840
I'll take this $100, turn it into $5000...
把這一百元變成五千

285
00:17:33,080 --> 00:17:36,350
...and I'll turn that into enough to get my movie going!
到時再連三翻 就有錢讓電影重新開拍了

286
00:17:37,350 --> 00:17:38,610
Good luck.
祝你好運了

287
00:17:38,850 --> 00:17:41,250
I don't need luck. I've thought this through.
錢德，我不需要好運 我已經想透了 

288
00:17:41,490 --> 00:17:42,510
I see.
我懂了

289
00:17:51,300 --> 00:17:52,730
Thanks.
謝謝你 多謝

290
00:17:52,900 --> 00:17:56,360
I can't believe this. This is like the worst night ever.
不敢相信，今晚真是糟透了

291
00:17:56,570 --> 00:17:59,940
You had a minor setback in your relationship.
摩妮卡，你和錢德的關係 有了小小挫折

292
00:18:00,210 --> 00:18:01,870
Big deal. It's only Chandler.
有啥大不了？不過是錢德罷了

293
00:18:03,780 --> 00:18:06,410
I am so sorry.
我真的很遺憾

294
00:18:08,280 --> 00:18:11,410
This is crazy. Such a stupid argument....
我們吵架的理由太蠢了 

295
00:18:11,690 --> 00:18:13,380
I don't wanna see Richard.
我根本不想跟理查再見面

296
00:18:13,590 --> 00:18:15,560
So go fix it.
那就去挽回啊

297
00:18:15,790 --> 00:18:18,520
Find Chandler. He's probably in your room.
去找錢德 他八成就待在你房間裡

298
00:18:18,730 --> 00:18:20,590
Tell him sorry and you love him.
跟他說對不起，說你愛他

299
00:18:21,130 --> 00:18:22,890
You're right,Phoebe.
菲比，你說的對

300
00:18:23,100 --> 00:18:24,590
-Thank you. -Sure.
謝謝你 小意思

301
00:18:25,800 --> 00:18:29,100
Yeah! Las Vegas! Number one!
好耶，叫賭城第一名！

302
00:18:39,710 --> 00:18:41,180
Anybody lose this?
這是誰掉的嗎？

303
00:18:41,350 --> 00:18:43,610
Coming out. Place your bet.
下注吧

304
00:18:44,620 --> 00:18:46,180
Dice her out.
下好離手

305
00:18:48,460 --> 00:18:50,480
Yellow 11. Pay the front line!
一賠二，不還本

306
00:18:59,230 --> 00:19:02,730
So I'm on my way back to the bathroom.
我正好要去廁所

308
00:19:05,710 --> 00:19:09,010
All right, all right. Just keep walking, all right?
好啦…繼續走就是了

309
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:20,550
What are you? I am sorry,sir.
羅斯，你幹嘛… 先生，對不起

310
00:19:20,750 --> 00:19:23,750
I think he just really likes you.
他太喜歡你了

311
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:33,020
You know that teacher who had a baby with her student?
你知道那個老師嗎？ 跟學生生孩子的那個？

312
00:19:42,814 --> 00:19:43,940
搞什麼…

313
00:19:44,680 --> 00:19:46,170
-Can I help you? -Yes.
嗨 小姐，需要我效勞嗎？對

314
00:19:46,380 --> 00:19:51,220
Do you have any extra pants? My friend seems to have had a little accident.
不好意思 你們有多的褲子嗎？ 我朋友出了點小狀況

316
00:19:56,890 --> 00:19:59,520
-Can I change $100? -Changing $100.
可以換一百元籌碼嗎？ 換一百元籌碼

317
00:20:00,630 --> 00:20:02,890
-Good luck, sir. -Thanks.
先生，祝您好運

318
00:20:04,770 --> 00:20:06,100
That's right.
全押了

319
00:20:11,070 --> 00:20:13,130
-Thirteen. -Hit me!
13點 再來

321
00:20:14,610 --> 00:20:16,600
Oh,man!
要命！

322
00:20:19,410 --> 00:20:20,570
Wait!
慢著！

323
00:20:22,780 --> 00:20:24,880
You are not gonna believe this!
錢德，說了你一定不相信

324
00:20:25,090 --> 00:20:27,820
I have found my identical hand twin.
我找到我的雙胞手了！

325
00:20:31,890 --> 00:20:33,120
What?
什麼？

326
00:20:33,990 --> 00:20:35,890
My identical hand twin!
我的雙胞手啊！

327
00:20:37,330 --> 00:20:39,030
What's an identical hand twin?
什麼是雙胞手？

328
00:20:39,200 --> 00:20:40,690
What does it sound like?
聽起來像什麼？ 

329
00:20:40,870 --> 00:20:44,030
It's a guy with my identical hands.
有個人的手跟我一模一樣

330
00:20:44,200 --> 00:20:47,870
It was incredible. The dealer's hands were exactly like mine.
錢德，太不可思議了 發牌員的手跟我一模一樣

331
00:20:48,180 --> 00:20:50,540
It was like looking at my hands in a mirror!
就跟照鏡子沒兩樣

332
00:20:52,180 --> 00:20:55,080
You sure you weren't looking at your hands in a mirror?
你確定不是在照鏡子？

333
00:20:56,080 --> 00:20:59,950
Don't you see what this means? I can forget about that stupid movie.
你不懂這件事的意義嗎？ 我大可忘了那部蠢電影

335
00:21:00,420 --> 00:21:02,010
I'm gonna be a millionaire!
我要變成百萬富翁了！

336
00:21:04,360 --> 00:21:07,820
-How? -I don't have it all worked out yet.
怎麼變？ 我還沒有完全想出來 

337
00:21:08,100 --> 00:21:11,690
But it's gotta mean big money. Come on, identical hands!
不過保證很有賺頭 拜託，一模一樣的手耶！

339
00:21:13,330 --> 00:21:15,320
Again,I must go back to...
我得再問一次

340
00:21:15,600 --> 00:21:17,000
...how?
怎麼賺？

341
00:21:18,370 --> 00:21:22,100
This is Vegas,man. People will pay to see freaky stuff!
這裡可是賭城 大家就愛付錢看怪東西

343
00:21:24,010 --> 00:21:26,610
How much would you pay to see this hand...
好，你願意付多少錢 看這隻手

344
00:21:26,850 --> 00:21:28,540
...twice?
兩次？

345
00:21:32,350 --> 00:21:34,880
I can't really put a price on that.
喬伊，我說不太出個價錢

346
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:37,780
Are you un-supporting me again?
你又不支持我了？

347
00:21:39,560 --> 00:21:43,190
I support you 100%. I just didn't get it right away.
不…我百分之百支持你 只是我一時沒回過神來

348
00:21:43,460 --> 00:21:44,860
Now I'm caught up.
我現在懂了

349
00:21:45,130 --> 00:21:46,900
Identical hand twins.
雙胞手！

350
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,630
It's a million-dollar idea!
這點子值上一百萬

351
00:21:48,840 --> 00:21:52,330
Right? I know. Okay. All right.
我知道…

352
00:21:52,510 --> 00:21:53,500
What's that for?
那是幹嘛的？

353
00:21:53,670 --> 00:21:58,130
Well,I gotta document this before that dealer gets off his break.
照相存證，免得發牌員落跑 

355
00:22:03,420 --> 00:22:05,280
I found my identical hand twin!
我找到我的雙胞手了！

357
00:22:05,490 --> 00:22:07,680
Oh,you're so lucky!
你真幸運

358
00:22:12,360 --> 00:22:15,160
So where's Monica? Did you guys make up?
摩妮卡呢？你們和好沒？

359
00:22:16,600 --> 00:22:18,290
But she just came up here.
沒有啊 可是她剛才上來了啊

361
00:22:18,630 --> 00:22:20,190
That was Joey.
那是喬伊

362
00:22:20,830 --> 00:22:22,960
I wonder where she is? It's so weird.
怪了，那她去了哪裡？

363
00:22:23,170 --> 00:22:25,040
She's probably talking to Richard.
或許在跟理查說話吧

364
00:22:25,310 --> 00:22:26,970
Would you stop that?
你有完沒完？

365
00:22:27,610 --> 00:22:30,870
You know what she said after her lunch with Richard?
你知道他和理查吃完中飯 回來後第一句話是什麼嗎？

366
00:22:31,140 --> 00:22:33,940
She didn't feel anything for him. She loves you.
她對他完全沒感覺了 她愛的是你

367
00:22:35,320 --> 00:22:36,980
-Really? -Yes.
真的？ 對

368
00:22:37,180 --> 00:22:41,620
She feels terrible. She really wants to make up. You've gotta find her.
而且她很難過 她真的很想跟你和好 你一定得找到她

370
00:22:45,060 --> 00:22:46,290
Good.
好

372
00:22:53,130 --> 00:22:55,660
I should really start wearing hats.
我真應該開始戴帽子

373
00:23:12,023 --> 00:23:13,217
我的色子呢？

374
00:23:41,780 --> 00:23:43,840
Welcome to Las Vegas.
歡迎來到賭城

375
00:23:45,020 --> 00:23:47,150
-Did you enjoy your flight? -I did.
一路還愉快嗎？ 對

376
00:23:47,350 --> 00:23:49,880
Thank you very much. It was excellent.
謝謝，非常棒

377
00:23:51,090 --> 00:23:55,080
-I hope you had a nice flight. -Oh,it was the best.
希望您一路還愉快 太愉快了

378
00:24:00,270 --> 00:24:02,670
I think the check-in is that way.
登記櫃檯應該在那裡

379
00:24:10,540 --> 00:24:12,440
Kids love me.
小孩子最喜歡我了

380
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:15,610
Hi,you guys are here!
菲比 你們來了！

381
00:24:16,520 --> 00:24:19,280
What'd you do? Did you go to a costume party?
嗨 你去參加化妝舞會了？

382
00:24:20,190 --> 00:24:22,590
Let me guess. Pancho Villa.
我來猜，你是扮龐丘維亞（墨西哥革命英雄）？ 

383
00:24:24,690 --> 00:24:26,560
And you're Bob Saget.
你是鮑伯塞吉（演員）

384
00:24:28,900 --> 00:24:29,950
Pancho Villa?
龐丘維亞？ 是啊

385
00:24:31,930 --> 00:24:34,900
What are you talking about,Phoebe? I don't
菲比，你在說什麼啊？ 我不…

386
00:24:38,070 --> 00:24:40,730
Oh,my God! You drew on me?
天啊，你偷畫我？

387
00:24:40,940 --> 00:24:43,030
Hey,you wet my pants!
誰叫你弄濕我褲子！

388
00:24:43,980 --> 00:24:45,710
What kind of party was this?
這是哪種派對啊？

389
00:24:46,750 --> 00:24:50,410
I've been walking around like this? You have so crossed a line.
我打從下飛機就是這樣子 你實在是太過份了

390
00:24:51,220 --> 00:24:53,950
Rach,wait. The men's room is that way.
瑞秋，等等，男廁在那裡

391
00:25:00,490 --> 00:25:03,830
It's the third time she's won on a machine I was playing.
怎麼了？ 那女士接我手玩，結果贏錢 這已經是第三次了

393
00:25:05,000 --> 00:25:06,760
I bet she's one of those people.
我賭她一定是那種人

394
00:25:08,240 --> 00:25:09,630
Mole people?
間諜？

395
00:25:10,500 --> 00:25:11,840
What? No, a lurker.
不是啦，是跟賭人

396
00:25:12,740 --> 00:25:13,730
What's that?
跟賭人是什麼？

397
00:25:13,910 --> 00:25:16,640
When you're playing a machine and it hasn't paid out...
你玩賭博機，沒有贏錢

398
00:25:16,910 --> 00:25:19,240
...a lurker waits for you to give up and then
跟賭人等你放棄就來接手玩 然後…

399
00:25:19,480 --> 00:25:20,470
Kills you?
殺你滅口？

400
00:25:22,820 --> 00:25:25,340
They swoop in and steal your jackpot.
不是啦，他們半路殺進來 偷走本來你會中的大獎

401
00:25:27,490 --> 00:25:30,580
-How do you know about this? -My nana used to do it.
你怎麼會知道這種事 我褓姆以前就幹這行

403
00:25:31,260 --> 00:25:33,850
That's how she paid for my dance Karate lessons.
她就是用這收入 幫我付舞蹈…空手道的學費

404
00:25:34,830 --> 00:25:36,160
Dance karate?
舞蹈空手道？

405
00:25:36,360 --> 00:25:38,920
Yes,it's a deadly...
對，那是種...

406
00:25:39,130 --> 00:25:41,000
...but beautiful sport.
...美麗卻致命的運動

407
00:25:45,010 --> 00:25:47,030
-lt won't come off. -What?
我弄不掉 什麼？

408
00:25:47,340 --> 00:25:48,430
It won't come off.
我弄不掉

409
00:25:48,680 --> 00:25:50,840
Oh,my God. Rach, are you sure?
天啊，瑞秋，你確定嗎？

410
00:25:51,040 --> 00:25:53,480
I took it off and then I drew it back on.
不確定，其實我弄掉了 又自己再畫回去

411
00:25:55,380 --> 00:25:58,680
Rach,I'm sorry. I'm so sorry. I'm sure we can get it off,okay?
我真的很抱歉 我確定一定可以弄掉的

412
00:25:58,850 --> 00:26:01,290
-Just give me your pen. -Why? What are you gonna do?
把你的筆給我 幹嘛？做什麼用？

413
00:26:01,450 --> 00:26:03,750
Well,I believe I'm going to stab you repeatedly.
我要讓你萬筆穿心

415
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:08,330
Not here. There are cameras everywhere.
別在這裡 到處都有監視攝影機

416
00:26:09,630 --> 00:26:10,620
You made it!
你們到了！

417
00:26:10,802 --> 00:26:12,326
喬伊

418
00:26:13,630 --> 00:26:15,030
Who's your friend? He's hot.
你朋友是誰？他真辣

419
00:26:16,800 --> 00:26:17,790
Thanks,man.
多謝誇獎

420
00:26:18,070 --> 00:26:22,130
Listen,I talked to Chandler. And I'm sorry about the movie.
錢德跟我說過了 電影的事我很遺憾

421
00:26:22,340 --> 00:26:23,330
Don't be sorry.
不用抱歉

422
00:26:23,540 --> 00:26:26,910
I don't need it anymore. I found my identical hand twin.
不要也罷 我找到我的雙胞手

423
00:26:27,650 --> 00:26:28,640
Your what?
你的什麼？ 

424
00:26:28,850 --> 00:26:32,340
My identical hand twin. The person whose hands are like mine.
我的雙胞手 那個人的手掌跟我完全一樣

426
00:26:32,820 --> 00:26:37,420
-Were you looking for this person? -Not even. This thing is a gold mine.
你特別去找的？ 正好撞見的，這可是金礦

427
00:26:37,620 --> 00:26:38,850
What?
什麼？

428
00:26:40,460 --> 00:26:42,550
That won't make you any money.
靠那個賺不了錢的

429
00:26:42,760 --> 00:26:44,090
Well,fine.
好，你這樣想也無所謂

430
00:26:44,360 --> 00:26:47,770
None of you will live with me in my hand-shaped mansion.
到時我蓋了手掌形的大廈 你們誰都休想來住

431
00:26:49,700 --> 00:26:52,040
Except you. You can live in the thumb.
菲比，你例外，大拇指給你住

432
00:26:54,770 --> 00:26:56,770
All right,baby,come on!
好吧，加油！

433
00:26:58,280 --> 00:26:59,680
I am on fire!
漂亮！擋都擋不住！

434
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:01,240
See you later.
摩妮卡，再見

435
00:27:01,410 --> 00:27:02,880
What are you doing?
等等，錢德，你在幹嘛？

436
00:27:03,080 --> 00:27:04,740
What's it look like? Going home.
你看呢？我要回家

437
00:27:04,950 --> 00:27:06,180
Why?
等等，為什麼？

439
00:27:09,020 --> 00:27:13,020
Wait. Sorry,I was just playing for one second.
你等等 對不起，我只是下來玩一下

441
00:27:13,230 --> 00:27:16,560
If you don't want me to see Richard again,I won't.
我本來打算要跟你說 若你不讓我理查再見面 我答應

442
00:27:16,800 --> 00:27:18,420
He means nothing to me.
他對我沒有任何意義

443
00:27:18,630 --> 00:27:20,960
Oh,come on. I was there.
得了吧，我又不是瞎子

444
00:27:23,700 --> 00:27:25,470
I know he's the love of your life.
我知道他是你追求的真愛

445
00:27:26,770 --> 00:27:28,100
Not anymore.
現在不是了

446
00:27:29,480 --> 00:27:31,000
Really?
真的？

447
00:27:31,380 --> 00:27:33,040
Really.
真的

448
00:27:36,220 --> 00:27:37,620
All right?

449
00:27:37,820 --> 00:27:41,650
Let's forget about going home and celebrate our anniversary.
忘了什麼要回家的事 我們來慶祝週年紀念日

450
00:27:43,460 --> 00:27:44,920
Okay, this is empty.
袋子裡是空的

451
00:27:45,790 --> 00:27:49,090
I wanted to make a dramatic scene, but I hate packing.
我想要搞得很戲劇化 可是我又討厭打包

452
00:27:56,300 --> 00:27:57,530
Where's the other guy?
另一個人呢？

453
00:27:57,740 --> 00:27:59,000
Which guy?
哪個人？

454
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:01,900
Tall,dark hair,hand looks exactly like this?
高高的，深色頭髮 手掌跟我一模一樣，你看

455
00:28:02,680 --> 00:28:06,170
I don't know about the hands, but he went to the restroom.
我不知道什麼手掌的 不過在我之前的發牌員 剛去上廁所了

457
00:28:06,484 --> 00:28:07,473
好

458
00:28:12,990 --> 00:28:14,510
How you doing?
你好嗎？

459
00:28:15,690 --> 00:28:18,320
-Very busy. -Right. Okay.
我很忙 對耶！好吧

461
00:28:22,860 --> 00:28:25,800
Yes,hello. I have a question.
你好，我有個問題

462
00:28:26,100 --> 00:28:30,260
I used your pen to draw on my friend's face.
我用你們的筆，畫我朋友的臉

463
00:28:31,100 --> 00:28:33,160
A beard and a mustache.
畫了鬍子

464
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:36,860
Thank you.
謝謝你

465
00:28:39,280 --> 00:28:41,340
No,she didn't think so.
不，她不以為然

466
00:28:41,610 --> 00:28:43,610
I know. It's like Anyway....
對啊，那其實…

467
00:28:45,220 --> 00:28:49,380
Makeup didn't cover it, we've tried everything and nothing's worked.
用化妝品蓋不過去 我們試過所有方法都去不掉

468
00:28:49,690 --> 00:28:51,520
What do we do?
這要怎麼辦？

469
00:28:52,497 --> 00:28:55,796
對，是…

470
00:28:58,130 --> 00:28:59,790
Thank you.
好…多謝

471
00:29:00,200 --> 00:29:02,070
Yeah, it's not coming off.
對，這個墨水擦不掉

472
00:29:03,040 --> 00:29:04,870
What? What else did he say?
什麼？那他還說了什麼？

473
00:29:05,070 --> 00:29:08,340
He said he thought I was funny.
他說他覺得我很逗

474
00:29:10,340 --> 00:29:13,340
Okay, look. Let's just go downstairs...
好，你聽我說… 我們下樓去...

475
00:29:13,580 --> 00:29:16,910
...we'll have some fun and you will forget all about it.
好好玩玩 你就會忘記這回事了

476
00:29:17,150 --> 00:29:20,210
There's no way I am leaving looking like this!
休想，羅斯，我頂著這個樣子 絕對不出房門

477
00:29:20,420 --> 00:29:22,510
Come on,Rach. It's not that bad.
別這樣啦，沒有那麼難看

478
00:29:22,760 --> 00:29:24,750
Ross,I am a human doodle!
羅斯，我變成人體塗鴉了！

479
00:29:26,230 --> 00:29:30,490
Just because some idiot drew on your face doesn't mean you can't have fun.
別因為一個白癡在你臉上亂畫 而阻礙你玩樂的權利

480
00:29:30,730 --> 00:29:32,930
Besides,no one will even look at you.
而且又沒人會看你

481
00:29:33,170 --> 00:29:37,000
This is Vegas. Hello? There are tons of other freaks here.
這裡可是賭城，怪人一大堆

482
00:29:38,540 --> 00:29:43,600
There are tons of freaks here. No other. No.
這裡有一大堆怪人，你不算

483
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:46,540
Come on. No one will notice. I swear.
走啦，我發誓沒人會注意到

484
00:29:53,720 --> 00:29:56,450
There was some staring and pointing.
好啦，是有一些人指指點點

485
00:29:58,460 --> 00:29:59,620
I need a drink.
我得喝點酒

486
00:30:00,390 --> 00:30:03,020
They really overcharge you for that stuff.
冰箱裡的酒都太貴了

487
00:30:04,860 --> 00:30:07,860
But who cares, because it's all on me.
但是誰在乎呢？我請客

488
00:30:12,440 --> 00:30:15,030
That is one big drink.
你的一點酒還真不少

489
00:30:15,980 --> 00:30:17,910
Macadamia nut?
要吃夏威夷果仁嗎？

490
00:30:18,380 --> 00:30:20,870
Wow! That's some pricey nut.
這個果仁還真值錢

491
00:30:23,250 --> 00:30:25,480
Really like those macadamia nuts?
你真的很喜歡吃果仁呢

492
00:30:25,990 --> 00:30:26,970
Nope.
不喜歡

493
00:30:41,300 --> 00:30:43,460
Get out of here, you lurker!
跟賭人，走開啦

494
00:30:43,700 --> 00:30:45,030
Go on,get!
滾啦

495
00:30:48,610 --> 00:30:49,870
You made up.
你們和好了

497
00:30:50,610 --> 00:30:52,640
I couldn't be mad at him for too long.
是啊，我沒辦法一直生他的氣

498
00:30:52,850 --> 00:30:54,780
She couldn't live without the "Chand love."
沒有錢德的愛，她就不能活

499
00:30:59,020 --> 00:31:00,010
Get a room.
去開房間啦

500
00:31:01,350 --> 00:31:03,320
-We have one. -Use it.
我們有房間 我知道，快去用啊

501
00:31:05,730 --> 00:31:08,160
Bye,Chandler. Bye,Mon.
錢德，摩妮卡，再見

502
00:31:15,600 --> 00:31:19,200
Phoebe,Phoebe. Please pick up a house phone.
菲比…請至店內接電話 

503
00:31:19,370 --> 00:31:22,240
You have a call from Chandler and Mon.
錢德和摩妮卡有事找

504
00:31:25,180 --> 00:31:28,910
Hello,Chandler and Mon. Hello?
喂？錢德、摩妮卡，喂？…

505
00:31:34,050 --> 00:31:36,520
You dirty lurker!
你這個死跟賭人

506
00:31:37,420 --> 00:31:42,220
I'm sorry,you are the same old lady,right? Yeah. Dirty lurker!
抱歉，你就是那位老太太吧？ 死跟賭人！

508
00:31:47,800 --> 00:31:50,500
That's right. Take good care of those babies.
可得好好照顧你的手

509
00:31:51,140 --> 00:31:52,130
Excuse me?
你說什麼？ 

510
00:31:52,340 --> 00:31:53,330
It's me. Joey.
我是喬伊啊

511
00:31:53,540 --> 00:31:54,730
Do I know you?
我認識你嗎？

512
00:31:56,080 --> 00:31:57,470
Joey?
喬伊啊

513
00:32:00,980 --> 00:32:03,240
Yeah, the hand guy.
秀手的那個

514
00:32:03,520 --> 00:32:06,850
So, what are we gonna do about this hand twin thing?
我們要怎麼處理雙胞手的事？

515
00:32:08,050 --> 00:32:09,250
Nothing.
不用處理？

516
00:32:10,220 --> 00:32:13,320
Look,you and I have been given a gift.
你和我擁有上帝的賜禮

517
00:32:13,530 --> 00:32:17,430
We have to do something with it. Like hand modeling. Or magic.
我們得要好好利用 好比手部模特兒或是變魔術

518
00:32:17,660 --> 00:32:20,430
And you know NASA's gonna want to talk to us.
太空總署一定也想找我們聊聊

519
00:32:22,040 --> 00:32:23,900
I have to get back to work.
我得回去工作了… 等等…

520
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:26,000
We can have our own show.
我們可以自己組秀

521
00:32:26,210 --> 00:32:29,440
We can clap our hands together. People will love it!
我們把手掌合在一起 大家一定超愛看的

522
00:32:31,410 --> 00:32:33,400
And I wrote a song for us.
我還替我們寫了一首主題曲

523
00:32:33,680 --> 00:32:36,210
This hand is your hand
這是你的手

524
00:32:37,350 --> 00:32:39,750
This hand is my hand
這是我的手

525
00:32:40,290 --> 00:32:42,550
Oh,wait,that's your hand
等等，那是你的手才對

526
00:32:44,520 --> 00:32:46,920
No,wait,it's my hand
不對，是我的手才對

527
00:32:49,430 --> 00:32:53,090
-That's okay. -But you haven't even heard the chorus!
還是算了 你還沒聽到副歌啊

529
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:56,860
Oh,my God.
天啊

530
00:32:57,240 --> 00:32:59,700
I look like my great-aunt Muriel.
我現在看起來 就像我姑婆茉莉兒

531
00:33:00,470 --> 00:33:01,940
All right,you know what?

532
00:33:02,210 --> 00:33:04,270
We don't have to go downstairs.
其實我們用不著下樓

533
00:33:04,480 --> 00:33:07,110
We can bring Vegas up to us.
房間裡就可以是賭城

534
00:33:07,380 --> 00:33:08,570
All right,come on.
快

535
00:33:08,820 --> 00:33:11,480
We'll play some blackjack. Here we go.
我們來玩21點 來羅

537
00:33:12,150 --> 00:33:13,140
-Thirteen. -Hit me.
13點 再加

538
00:33:14,050 --> 00:33:15,950
Twenty-three.
23，爆了

539
00:33:17,390 --> 00:33:21,050
Which is what we play to at this casino!
我們這裡23點最大

540
00:33:22,730 --> 00:33:24,290
You win 10 dollars!
你贏了10美元

541
00:33:24,500 --> 00:33:26,660
-I bet 20. -Right.
我押了20美元 沒錯

542
00:33:31,900 --> 00:33:34,810
A new pair of shoes for the Chan-Chan man!
幫我的小錢錢買雙新鞋

543
00:33:37,310 --> 00:33:39,400
I've never seen a roll like this!
我這輩子還沒看過有這麼旺的

545
00:33:39,650 --> 00:33:40,840
That's right, baby!
寶貝，你說對了

546
00:33:41,080 --> 00:33:42,410
What do I want now?
這次要押幾號？

548
00:33:44,180 --> 00:33:45,450
Eight?
好，8號？

549
00:33:45,850 --> 00:33:49,810
-Six. -Pick a number! That is your only job.
還是6號？ 選一個啦！你只有這個任務！

550
00:33:50,090 --> 00:33:51,280
-Eight. -Thank you.
8號… 8號

551
00:33:51,490 --> 00:33:54,360
If you get this, we buy everybody a steak dinner.
如果你中了這一把 晚餐就請在場的各位吃牛排

552
00:33:57,630 --> 00:33:59,100
Eight it is.
8號

553
00:34:00,370 --> 00:34:02,330
We're not buying steak dinners,are we?
我們真的要請他們吃牛排？ 

554
00:34:02,540 --> 00:34:04,200
-No. -Okay,good.
假的 那就好

555
00:34:05,610 --> 00:34:07,770
-What do I want now? -Try a hard eight.
這次要押幾號？ 再硬押個8  

556
00:34:07,970 --> 00:34:09,500
-What? -Two fours.
什麼？4加4啦

558
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:12,210
Eight!
8號

559
00:34:13,180 --> 00:34:16,170
Don't you let her go. You're a lucky guy.
千萬要把握住她，你太幸運了

560
00:34:16,380 --> 00:34:18,610
Thank you,Mr. Drunken Gambler.
謝謝你，醉賭徒先生

561
00:34:19,390 --> 00:34:22,820
You get this and we get the biggest suite in the place.
好，如果你中了這一把 我們就租下這裡最大的套房

563
00:34:26,790 --> 00:34:29,020
We get the biggest suite in the place.
等等…我說的是我和她租下這裡最大的套房

564
00:34:29,230 --> 00:34:30,990
The biggest suite in the place!
好，這裡最大的套房來羅

565
00:34:31,200 --> 00:34:32,360
Come on!

566
00:34:34,200 --> 00:34:36,570
I love you! I can't remember why we fought.
我愛你 我都忘記我們在吵什麼了

568
00:34:36,870 --> 00:34:38,730
Because I had lunch with Rich
因為我和理查吃中飯…

569
00:34:39,040 --> 00:34:40,300
Me neither!
我也忘了！

570
00:34:41,040 --> 00:34:43,030
-What now? -Another hard eight.
這次要押幾號？ 再硬押一次8

571
00:34:43,310 --> 00:34:45,470
Hard eight? Let's call it easy eight!
硬押8？簡單8才對

573
00:34:45,750 --> 00:34:49,040
I'll tell you what. You roll another hard eight...
好，這樣吧，如果這次再中…

574
00:34:49,750 --> 00:34:52,380
...and we get married here tonight.
我們今晚就在這裡結婚

575
00:34:54,992 --> 00:34:56,290
快啊…

576
00:34:57,260 --> 00:34:58,880
Shut up!
閉嘴！

577
00:35:01,330 --> 00:35:03,730
It just got interesting!
好戲才正要上場！

578
00:35:07,170 --> 00:35:08,430
What did you say?
你剛才說什麼？

579
00:35:08,840 --> 00:35:11,700
You roll another hard eight, we get married tonight.
你再贏一次8 我們今晚就在這裡結婚

580
00:35:12,710 --> 00:35:14,000
You serious?
你是認真的？

581
00:35:14,170 --> 00:35:15,640
Yes. I love you.
是啊，我愛你

582
00:35:15,840 --> 00:35:18,370
I've never loved anybody as much as I love you.
我不曾這樣愛過一個人

583
00:35:19,510 --> 00:35:22,000
I've never loved anybody as much as I love you.
我也不曾這樣愛過一個人

584
00:35:22,420 --> 00:35:26,250
So if an eight comes up, we take it as a sign and we do it.
好，如果再出8就是天意 我們趕今晚結婚

585
00:35:26,450 --> 00:35:27,940
What do you say?
好不好？

586
00:35:28,759 --> 00:35:30,226
Okay.
好

587
00:35:30,862 --> 00:35:33,831
來吧…

588
00:35:36,100 --> 00:35:37,120
That's a four.
有一個是4

589
00:35:37,400 --> 00:35:40,300
-And where's the other one? -Under the table.
另一個呢？ 掉到桌子底下了

590
00:35:40,930 --> 00:35:44,130
Nobody move! You look that way,I look this way.
通通不許動！ 你找那邊，我找這邊 好！

593
00:35:48,880 --> 00:35:50,270
Here it is,here it is.
在這裡…

594
00:35:52,080 --> 00:35:53,480
That could be 4 or 5.
一半4，一半5

595
00:35:56,550 --> 00:35:57,980
It's your call.
你決定

596
00:36:01,550 --> 00:36:03,220
It's a four.
那是4

597
00:36:06,630 --> 00:36:08,150
I think so too.
我也這樣覺得

598
00:36:35,150 --> 00:36:37,620
Oh, well, lost again.
好吧，又沒贏到錢

599
00:36:42,030 --> 00:36:44,330
That's it. You and me. Outside!
夠了，我們去外面解決

600
00:36:44,530 --> 00:36:48,090
I wouldn't want you to lose a chunk of that pretty blond hair!
我可不想看到 你美麗的金髮少了一撮

601
00:36:53,270 --> 00:36:54,500
Be cool.
假裝沒事…

602
00:36:58,310 --> 00:37:00,440
Okay, your lurking days are over.
女士，你跟賭的日子結束了

603
00:37:00,610 --> 00:37:01,640
What?
什麼？

604
00:37:01,850 --> 00:37:04,320
Everyone you lurk, I'll lurk first.
從現在開始 我要搶先你一步

605
00:37:04,550 --> 00:37:07,310
You move on, I'll be one step ahead of you...
不管你找誰下手 我都會捷足先登

606
00:37:07,520 --> 00:37:08,780
...every single time.
一次都不放過

607
00:37:08,990 --> 00:37:12,620
And then I'll be on your ass every hour of every day...
我每天都會緊緊跟著你…

608
00:37:12,860 --> 00:37:14,450
...till Monday...
直到星期一

609
00:37:14,730 --> 00:37:17,030
...because that's when I go home.
因為我那天要回家

610
00:37:17,800 --> 00:37:18,790
When do you leave?
你何時要回家？

611
00:37:19,000 --> 00:37:20,470
Also Monday.
也是星期一

612
00:37:20,700 --> 00:37:23,030
What time? Maybe we can share a cab.
幾點？說不定能共乘計程車

613
00:37:25,470 --> 00:37:26,630
Hit me.
再加

614
00:37:27,340 --> 00:37:28,710
Hit me.
再加

615
00:37:29,647 --> 00:37:30,705
再加

616
00:37:31,816 --> 00:37:32,874
再加

617
00:37:34,018 --> 00:37:35,144
再加

618
00:37:36,387 --> 00:37:37,547
再加

619
00:37:38,880 --> 00:37:40,180
We need more cards.
我們得再去買牌

620
00:37:41,820 --> 00:37:45,220
Yeah. And we also need more drinks. Hold on a second.
對，還要再來點酒，你等等

621
00:37:47,231 --> 00:37:48,129
好了

622
00:37:48,830 --> 00:37:50,390
Hello,Vegas?
賭城嗎？

623
00:37:52,200 --> 00:37:53,760
We would like more alcohol.
我們還需要酒 

624
00:37:54,070 --> 00:37:56,930
You know what else? We would like some more beers.
對了，再來點啤酒

625
00:37:59,770 --> 00:38:02,070
Oh,I forgot to dial.
我竟然忘了撥號

626
00:38:05,850 --> 00:38:08,870
That must be our alcohol and beers.
一定是送酒來了

627
00:38:13,720 --> 00:38:15,880
It's Joey! I love Joey!
是喬伊！我愛喬伊

628
00:38:16,120 --> 00:38:17,710
Oh,I love Joey!
我愛喬伊

629
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,220
Joey lives with a duck.
喬伊跟鴨子住一起

630
00:38:19,463 --> 00:38:20,760
嗨

631
00:38:21,930 --> 00:38:23,790
Look,I need some help, okay?
你們聽我說，我需要幫助

632
00:38:24,100 --> 00:38:27,190
Someone has to convince my hand twin to cooperate.
誰去叫我那雙胞手合作點

633
00:38:27,430 --> 00:38:32,300
I'll do it. Whatever you need me to do, I'm your man.
我去 不管你有什麼需要 找我就對了

635
00:38:37,210 --> 00:38:39,140
Are you okay?
你還好吧？

636
00:38:41,780 --> 00:38:43,750
Yeah. Fine. Thanks.
對，我很好，謝了

637
00:38:46,890 --> 00:38:47,940
Hey, Rach?
瑞秋

638
00:38:48,590 --> 00:38:50,320
How you doing?
你好嗎？

639
00:38:52,930 --> 00:38:55,720
I'm doing good, baby. How you doing?
寶貝，我很好，你呢？

640
00:38:57,560 --> 00:38:59,330
Don't let her drink anymore.
羅斯，別再讓她喝了

641
00:39:03,240 --> 00:39:07,070
Here's that macadamia nut.
是那顆夏威夷果仁

642
00:39:09,110 --> 00:39:10,940
No,something else.
不對，是別的東西

643
00:39:16,820 --> 00:39:18,680
So, what do you wanna do now?
好吧，你現在要幹嘛？

644
00:39:18,920 --> 00:39:21,110
I wanna get out of the room.
我要離開這房間

646
00:39:22,920 --> 00:39:26,020
I really miss downstairs.
我真想念樓下

647
00:39:26,830 --> 00:39:31,320
Okay,you know what? There is only one way I am leaving this hotel room.
我跟你說，要我離開這間房 只有一個方法

648
00:39:33,270 --> 00:39:34,860
Well,hello!
嗨

649
00:39:36,100 --> 00:39:37,830
I'm Ross.
我是羅斯

650
00:39:38,340 --> 00:39:41,700
-Good luck to you. -Sir, you've got a little something....
祝你好運 抱歉，先生，你臉上有東西

652
00:39:47,510 --> 00:39:49,670
Hello.
你好 你好

653
00:39:49,787 --> 00:39:51,254
你好

654
00:40:17,480 --> 00:40:18,670
I won!
我贏了！

655
00:40:18,980 --> 00:40:20,670
I won! I finally won!
我贏了！我終於贏了

656
00:40:20,910 --> 00:40:22,640
I won! That was my quarter!
是我贏才對，那是我的硬幣

657
00:40:22,850 --> 00:40:23,910
Take a hike, toots.
好啦，還給你，滾吧

658
00:40:26,520 --> 00:40:27,880
Excuse me, sir.
先生，不好意思

659
00:40:28,090 --> 00:40:30,750
This lady played my quarter. This is my money.
這位小姐用我的硬幣玩 這是我贏的錢

660
00:40:30,990 --> 00:40:32,250
Is that true, miss?
小姐，真的是這樣嗎？

661
00:40:33,830 --> 00:40:35,320
Sells drugs to kids.
賣毒品給小孩

662
00:40:35,633 --> 00:40:36,759
什麼？

663
00:40:37,700 --> 00:40:39,530
She sells drugs to kids.
她賣毒品給小孩

664
00:40:40,930 --> 00:40:42,900
It was my quarter.
那是我的硬幣

665
00:40:43,100 --> 00:40:44,330
Was it her quarter?
那硬幣是她的嗎？

666
00:40:45,070 --> 00:40:47,730
How about we talk about this over dinner?
我們等吃晚餐再聊如何？

667
00:40:47,940 --> 00:40:51,710
-Okay, lady, you're out of here. -No,you can't arrest me!
好了，小姐，請你出去 不！…你不能逮捕我

669
00:40:51,910 --> 00:40:54,000
I won't go back to that hellhole!
我才不要重回火坑！

670
00:40:55,750 --> 00:40:58,240
I'm just taking you outside.
我只是要把你帶出去而已

671
00:40:58,622 --> 00:41:00,419
那好吧

672
00:41:04,060 --> 00:41:08,960
I need something old, something new, something borrowed and something blue.
快點，一定要湊齊四樣東西 我們才能結婚

674
00:41:10,060 --> 00:41:12,360
Here's something blue and new.
這是藍色的，而且也是新的

675
00:41:12,570 --> 00:41:15,030
You are so efficient. I love you.
我們真有效率，我愛你

676
00:41:15,430 --> 00:41:16,700
-Let's go. -No,wait!
走吧 還不行…

677
00:41:16,940 --> 00:41:18,460
We need something old.
我們還需要舊的東西

678
00:41:18,700 --> 00:41:22,470
I have a condom in my wallet that I've had since I was twelve.
好，我皮夾裡有個保險套 我從12歲放到現在

679
00:41:24,410 --> 00:41:25,810
That'll work.
那符合啊（亦指「還能用」）

680
00:41:25,980 --> 00:41:27,950
I don't think so.
我想應該不能用了

681
00:41:29,450 --> 00:41:30,570
Now something borrowed.
好，現在只剩借來的東西

682
00:41:32,490 --> 00:41:33,980
Here, just take this.
那就把這毛衣拿走 

683
00:41:35,290 --> 00:41:36,450
That's stealing.
這是偷竊耶

684
00:41:36,620 --> 00:41:38,820
We'll bring it back. Put it under your dress.
到時再還回來就是了 塞進你的洋裝裡

685
00:41:50,500 --> 00:41:52,470
Okay. One thing at a time.
好啦，先結婚再懷孕

686
00:42:06,650 --> 00:42:10,450
-Are you gonna play? -No,I don't really have any money.
你要玩嗎？ 不要，我沒半毛錢

687
00:42:11,160 --> 00:42:13,820
Not yet,anyway.
只是時候未到而已

688
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:17,020
Can't sit here if you don't play.
你不玩就不能坐在這裡

689
00:42:32,810 --> 00:42:35,540
My name is Regina Falangie.
嗨，我是瑞吉娜佛蘭姬

690
00:42:37,380 --> 00:42:40,050
I'm a businesswoman in town on business.
我是生意人，這趟是來出差的

691
00:42:40,250 --> 00:42:42,050
Would you like to see my card?
你要我的名片嗎？

692
00:42:42,250 --> 00:42:44,050
What did I do with my Filofax?
我的名片夾到哪兒去了？

693
00:42:44,260 --> 00:42:46,450
I must've left it in Conference Room B.
一定是忘在B會議室

694
00:42:47,590 --> 00:42:49,580
-Fourteen. -Hit me.
14點 再加

695
00:42:50,060 --> 00:42:51,120
Oh,my God.
天啊

696
00:42:51,300 --> 00:42:55,630
May I just say that you two gentlemen have the exact same hands?
兩位的手一模一樣

697
00:42:57,170 --> 00:42:58,530
They're identical.
一個模子刻出來的

698
00:42:58,740 --> 00:43:01,430
I've never seen that in the business world.
我在商業界做了這麼久 從來沒看過這種事

699
00:43:03,110 --> 00:43:04,800
Stop it.
別再說了

700
00:43:05,780 --> 00:43:10,580
Miss Falangie,may I ask you a question as an impartial person at this table?
佛蘭姬女士，以局外人的身份 我能請教你一個問題嗎？

701
00:43:10,780 --> 00:43:12,310
Please stop it.
請你別再說了

702
00:43:14,150 --> 00:43:17,180
Wouldn't you pay good money to see identical hands...
你願不願意花大錢 去看手長一模一樣的兩個人…

703
00:43:17,460 --> 00:43:21,790
...showcased in some type of an entertainment venue?
這種娛樂性的演出？

704
00:43:21,990 --> 00:43:25,860
If you leave now,I will chop off my hand and give it to you!
只要你願意離開 我就把手砍下來送你！

705
00:43:28,870 --> 00:43:30,630
Didn't I just throw you out?
我不是才把你趕出去了嗎？

706
00:43:31,140 --> 00:43:33,000
No, you threw out Phoebe.
不，你趕出去的是菲比 

707
00:43:33,210 --> 00:43:36,000
I'm Regina Falangie. Falangie.
我是瑞吉娜佛蘭姬女士

708
00:43:36,610 --> 00:43:38,370
Come on, lady.
小姐，你別鬧了

709
00:43:38,610 --> 00:43:39,940
Please take him too.
請你把他也帶走

710
00:43:40,150 --> 00:43:42,810
Me? Oh, come on, man.
我？別這樣嘛

711
00:43:43,020 --> 00:43:44,210
Come on, buddy.
走吧…

712
00:43:45,150 --> 00:43:47,380
Don't let him do this. Come on!
你不能這樣

713
00:43:47,690 --> 00:43:50,280
I'm your hand twin!
我是你的雙胞手耶

714
00:43:54,530 --> 00:43:56,720
Hello. One marriage,please.
嗨，登記結婚

715
00:43:57,030 --> 00:43:58,390
We want to get married.
對，我們要結婚

716
00:43:58,630 --> 00:44:01,290
There's a service in progress. Have a seat.
有婚禮正在進行，先請坐

717
00:44:01,800 --> 00:44:03,170
All right.
好吧…

718
00:44:12,010 --> 00:44:13,040
What are you doing?
你在幹嘛？

719
00:44:13,310 --> 00:44:16,010
The "Wedding March." Does that freak you out?
那是結婚進行曲 聽了有沒有嚇到？

720
00:44:16,220 --> 00:44:18,080
No, it's the graduation song.
沒有，因為那是畢業歌

721
00:44:24,420 --> 00:44:27,290
This is it. We're gonna get married.
好，來吧 我們要結婚了

723
00:44:27,490 --> 00:44:29,090
You sure you wanna do this?
你確定你真的想結婚？

724
00:44:34,730 --> 00:44:37,000
Hello, Mrs. Ross!
嗨，羅斯太太

725
00:44:37,240 --> 00:44:40,330
Well,hello, Mr. Rachel!
嗨，瑞秋先生

726
00:44:42,510 --> 00:44:44,270
Wait. Okay.
等等，好

727
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


728
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
